er-attachments/assets/7b7f00c4-3e71-4f9a-a851-8d8b5ace4f29\" />\r\n\r\nSome feedback:\r\n\r\n- I suggest using a different color for the X/Y/Z labels, so they can be distinguished more easily from the main diagonal distance. Right now, the labels can appear very close to each other (if not overlap), which reduces readability.\r\n  - Ideally, we could reuse the X/Y/Z axis colors from the 3D editor  (`axis_x_color` and so on), or an orange color for all axes if that's not feasible.\r\n  - If it's not too much work, this could also be applied to the lines drawn in the 3D viewport.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106785#pullrequestreview-3480052371","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106785","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-11-18T23:21:26Z"},{"id":4031900478,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7wUes-","state":"APPROVED","commit_id":"9bcaa773a2c3a30e327972213c1e62cc01f70770","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","login":"Calinou","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou"},"body":"Tested again on top of `master` https://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/2af785641ae249573f45eb61852d22e0b1a8a03c, it works great now 🙂 Code looks good to me.\n\n<img width=\"479\" height=\"242\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d3a11573-4dac-4fb1-99e1-7bdb7eb338a2\" />\n\n<img width=\"389\" height=\"297\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/378e81c9-1c33-441a-8cb7-65910f84b4ac\" />","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106785#pullrequestreview-4031900478","pul